  "description": "Retention of existing steel pergola, proposed installation of cladding\r\nand retractable roof to the existing steel pergola",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 107%;&quot;&gt;Insufficient information was submitted in relation to the\r\nexternal materials, and therefore it has not been demonstrated to the satisfaction\r\nof the Local Planning Authority that a high quality development would be\r\nachieved, which is considered essential given the sites wide and prominent\r\nposition along a main road. &amp;nbsp;Therefore,\r\nthe proposed development is contrary to the high quality deign aspirations of\r\nThe National Planning Policy Framework (2024), policy D3.D1, D3.D10 and D3.D12\r\nof The London Plan (2021), policy CS1 of The Harrow Core Strategy (2021), policy\r\nDM1 of the Harrow Development\r\nManagement Policies Local Plan 2013.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
